  1549    /*                                                                       */
  1550    /* <Input>                                                               */
  1551    /*    num_coords :: The number of available coordinates.  If it is       */
  1552    /*                  larger than the number of axes, ignore the excess    */
  1553    /*                  values.  If it is smaller than the number of axes,   */
  1554    /*                  use the default value (0) for the remaining axes.    */
  1555    /*                                                                       */
  1556    /*    coords     :: An array of `num_coords', each between [-1,1].       */
  1557    /*                                                                       */
